flowchart LR
    S1[Section 0\npage 1\nheading A] --> T[Ordered normalized text units]
    S2[Section 1\npage 2\nheading A] --> T
    S3[Section 2\npage 3\nheading B] --> T
    T --> C1[Chunk 0\ntoward target budget]
    C1 --> O[Bounded trailing overlap]
    O --> C2[Chunk 1\nnew content + overlap]
    C2 --> C3[Chunk 2]

    P1[Provenance: source-section range, page range, heading] -. attached .-> C1
    P2[Provenance recomputed from included units] -. attached .-> C2
    M[Hard token maximum is never exceeded]:::rule -. constrains .-> C1
    M -. constrains .-> C2
    M -. constrains .-> C3
    classDef rule fill:#fff8dc,stroke:#8a6d1d,color:#111;

